  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "####Lazy Evaluation\n- don't require communication with the driver\n- chain together operation with narrow dependency and let the spark evaluation engine do the work of consolidating them\n- Rdd contains dependecy info, lineage , can be parallelize torecaclutae the lost partition data\n\nconsecuences:  failure would not appear unless you call an action\n-- it shows the failure happens at the action",
